},{"x":0.61316873357775026,"y":0.2572674418999078,"h":0.01162790683971926,"w":0.24691356658935548,"text":"and lots and lots of water rushed in."},{"x":0.59053498128104509,"y":0.27034883708401636,"w":0.10905349731445313,"h":0.011645867144861599,"text":"E: Wow! That 3"},{"w":0.12551440238952627,"y":0.27180232550455896,"text":"really frightening.","x":0.7962962963103809,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"y":0.28488372099555881,"h":0.013081394879037367,"w":0.17283950805664072,"text":"F: Yeah, well, we were 4","x":0.58847736819390173},{"text":"because it","w":0.07407407283782963,"h":0.010220601299854915,"y":0.28633720969798748,"x":0.85802469074157894},{"w":0.32716049194335939,"text":"happened so quickly and the water hit us really","x":0.61111110878140673,"y":0.29920564852891651,"h":0.013294351279788175},{"h":0.013081394879037145,"x":0.60905349804308173,"w":0.051440329551696751,"text":"hard.S","y":0.31250000010408607},{"w":0.20576131820678711,"x":0.74691358300908917,"h":0.01162790683971926,"text":"-, nobody was seriously hurt.","y":0.31540697676424889},{"text":"E: What did you do?","x":0.5884773711742699,"h":0.011915269196822509,"w":0.15020575523376467,"y":0.32833186214470822},{"y":0.34156976789478366,"w":0.34567901611328122,"h":0.013240470364361046,"x":0.58847736423416863,"text":"F: Well, in the end we got to the island - wet but"},{"w":0.045267486572265647,"h":0.01162790683971926,"text":"very","x":0.6090534989463775,"y":0.35610465130397762},{"h":0.013268693821259836,"text":"to be back on dry land.","w":0.16255144119262699,"x":0.75102880886184831,"y":0.3561046514219155},{"x":0.58608403353321237,"w":0.13235868453979494,"y":0.36781974464942668,"text":"E: What a'-","h":0.020174464186207941},{"x":0.58847736707856191,"h":0.010365565688022937,"text":"F: 8","w":0.032921810150146391,"y":0.38372093043442157},{"y":0.38517441861502411,"w":0.18930040359497069,"x":0.70576132272926373,"h":0.01162790683971926,"text":"_, we'll take the slow boat."},{"text":"3 Complete each gap with one word."