's amazing! What did you say?","x":0.60699588939194338,"y":0.59883720960989995},{"x":0.58641975778681743,"text":"A: Well, to start 3","w":0.12345678329467769,"h":0.011647149933615486,"y":0.61191860457432645},{"x":0.77160494161394544,"y":0.61337209289796979,"w":0.17901233673095696,"text":"I didn't know what to say,","h":0.01162790683971926},{"text":"but fortunately, she was really friendly. *","y":0.62645348859476602,"w":0.27366254806518553,"x":0.60905350179045248,"h":0.014534883760080275},{"y":0.64077669904307566,"text":"the end, we chatted for about ten minutes and","h":0.01191526919682262,"x":0.60699587806687849,"w":0.32304527282714834},{"x":0.60699589430726586,"w":0.25720163345336922,"h":0.011915269196822509,"text":"I told her how much I love her books.","y":0.65533980572736772},{"y":0.66990291243588473,"w":0.16049381256103512,"x":0.58436214989232182,"text":"C: What a great story.","h":0.01191526919682262},{"h":0.011915269196822509,"x":0.58436213663653691,"y":0.68446601928975037,"text":"A: I know, and she signed my book!","w":0.25102880477905276},{"x":0.58230452335660454,"text":"Conversation 2: Andrew and Nancy","w":0.24897119522094735,"h":0.011627906839719149,"y":0.70203488384758228},{"text":"A: I'm afraid'","x":0.58436214129878328,"y":0.71800529585283723,"w":0.1028806591033935,"h":0.011645866723999143},{"y":0.71915480714735192,"x":0.73650743869608282,"w":0.07019499778747551,"h":0.013725268977570093,"text":"_horses."},{"y":0.73255813963896976,"text":"N: What? Why?","w":0.11316872596740724,"x":0.58230452678995892,"h":0.013249450727363499},{"w":0.35596706390380861,"x":0.5843621506201121,"text":"A: Well, when I was twelve years old, my neighbour","y":0.74845542813646926,"h":0.01191526919682262},{"w":0.20370368957519525,"h":0.010237278816243367,"text":"took me riding on her horse.","x":0.60288066889552983,"y":0.76301853479003268},{"w":0.030864195823669394,"h":0.011915269196822509,"text":"N: 2","x":0.58436214080558646,"y":0.77449249782087959},{"w":0.09080890655517581